c1ddf975-700e-4530-ae04-16a073f1dcb0-0
00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:44.520
No leaps of imagination required.

f5f06f79-80f3-45a1-a079-fb16d3d75aa1-0
00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:47.344
That way, our customers,
and our teams for that matter,

f5f06f79-80f3-45a1-a079-fb16d3d75aa1-1
