Yeah, descriptive is our default,
and there's a few main reasons for that.

ad7636ab-df78-4a40-9ccb-0126495a8f7e-0
00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:05.160
First, it's customer centric.

4aee299b-efb4-42da-8d81-5be5972b0114-0
