People prefer names they can immediately
understand,

4aee299b-efb4-42da-8d81-5be5972b0114-1
00:02:08.644 --> 00:02:12.080
especially in tech where things are
already complicated enough.

3b5bc93a-032f-4a47-94fe-4288b87eb44a-0
00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:14.760
Second, it saves time and money.

861e8726-b5f9-4f5f-8b9b-117f303a729e-0
